  "description": "The implicit or explicit belief that men are more deserving of societal rewards, recognition, or moral standing than women, often rooted in patriarchal norms. The meme contrasts the woman receiving benefits with the man dying on the streets, implying the man’s sacrifice is more valuable, which is a form of gender-based moral hierarchy.",
